  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "- **A System.Text.Json serializer comes with the package: `IInterprocessObjectSerializer.Json<T>(options)`,** for an object that needs no attributes or source generator, as MemoryPack's serializer does, and whose file a human can read. It keeps the object as UTF-8 JSON with the options given, or System.Text.Json's defaults. It adds no dependency: System.Text.Json is part of .NET.\n- **Requires newer minor versions of other Compze packages:** Compze.Internals.SystemCE 0.10.0-internal (was 0.8.0-internal), Compze.Threading 0.13.0-alpha (was 0.12.0-alpha). Upgrading to this version upgrades each package listed here too, so their changelogs apply to this upgrade as well.",
